+// flow_seed_demand — append a trivial legacy demand entry (run setup; the
+// harness lowers a demo's spawn intents, the app/determinism-test hardcode
+// one). Re-created identically on every replay (NOT in the action log — like
+// the fixture + seed). class defaults to 0 (email) for back-compat with the
